        "date": "2026-09-06T22:47:34-05:00",
        "subject": "perf(git): prefetch history notes in one git log (#2071)",
        "body": "* perf(git): prefetch history notes in one git log\n\nLoad the promotion-history notes for a CTPH window with a single git log so GetHistoryNote does not spawn git notes show per commit.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* perf(git): drop unused history-note cache clears\n\nThe cache lives on a per-reconcile EnvironmentOperations and is filled only after FetchNotes, so nothing in that reconcile has a populated map to invalidate.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "sha": "a8286becf2121de3a539c1e52035ee9bb93b3614",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
